/FRTS PATCH FOR MULTI8
/CREATED 10-FEB-77, ELC.
/MODIFIED 20-SEP-78, WVDM.

/THIS FILE SHOULD BE ASSEMBLED WITH PAL8 AND LOADED ON TOP OF THE
/FORTRAN IV RUNTIME SYSTEM, FRTS.SV, WITH THE BINARY LOADER.
/THE RESULT IS A FRTS VERSION SUITABLE TO RUN IN THE MULTI8 BACKGROUND
/AS WEL AS STAND ALONE !
/THIS PATCH FILE IS BASED ON FRTS V5A.
/THIS PATCH ALSO INCLUDES THE PHELPS USR MOD

/FIRST WE PATCH THE LOADER PART:
	FIELD 1
	*2466
1372	/TAD (5606	/
3771	/DCA I (7605	/SET UP OS8 RETURN SEQUENCE TO TRAP TO RTS
1370	/TAD (PDPXIT	/
3767	/DCA I (7606	/AS RANDOM RESTARTS COULD BE FATAL.
6552	/FPICL		/RE-INITIALIZE FPP (IF ANY)
6553	/FPCOM		/CLEAR APT POINTER FIELD BITS (IF FPP)
	/CLA IAC	/REMOVE ANALEX STUFF
	/6654		/LOAD PRINTER BUFFER ON ANALEX PRINTER
6203	/CDF CIF 0	/THIS IS A BETTER PLACE FOR CIF ....
7300	/CLA CLL	/START OF *USR* PATCH
1311	/TAD	XMAX
3010	/DCA	X0
1023	/TAD	MXFLD	/LOC IN F4 LOADER
3410	/DCA I	X0	/STORE IN MAXCOR=00121!!careful!!
3410	/DCA I	X0	/00122=0
1025	/TAD	HGHFLD	/ANOTHER LOC IN LOADER
3410	/DCA I	X0	/STORE IN HGHLOC=00123
1026	/TAD	HGHADR	/ONE MORE
3410	/DCA I	X0	/STORE IN HGHLOC+1=00124
7000	/NOP
5766	/JMP I	(FPSTRT
0120	/XMAX,MAXCOR-1

/MULTI8 DOES SUPPORT EAE, SO WHY NOT USE IT IF IT IS PRESENT ?
	FIELD 1
	*3751
	JMP .+3		/GO TEST FOR MULTI8
	*3754		/SOME FREE LOCATIONS !
	6254		/SKIP ON MULTI8
	3767		/NO, KILL EAE FOR RTS8 (JUST BECAUSE OF A LAZY PROGRAMMER)
	5726		/RETURN FROM BAKTST

/BRKLST CONTAINS SECTIONS OF CODE THAT ARE PATCHED OVER THE RUN TIME SYSTEM
/IF WE RUN IN THE BACKGROUND OF RTS8. HOWEVER, WE DON'T WANT TO KILL THE PAPERTAPE STUFF. ALSO,
/IN MULTI8 THE ^B CHARACTER CAN'T BE USED. SO WE MAKE A TRACE BACK
/FOR ^C INTERRUPTIONS.
	FIELD 0
	*5340
	RELOC 244
	JMS CTCBCK	/^C CHECK IN ALTERNATE LPT HANDLER
	5636		/JMP I LPT
	JMS CTCBCK	/^C CHECK FOR JUMPS
	RELOC

	*5345
	272
	6026		/PUNCH THE CHARACTER
	CLA
	5670		/JMP I PTP
	0
	310
	RFC RRB		/FETCH CHARACTER
	5706		/JMP I PTR
	0
	320
	RELOC 321
	SNA
	JMP KBDRTS
	TLS		/NO NEED TO TEST FLAG
	CLA
	JMS CTCBCK
	5720		/JMP I TTY
KBDRTS,	KSF
	JMP .-1
	JMS CTCBCK	/CHECK FOR ^C
	KRB
	5720		/JMP I TTY	/MULTI8 DOES SET PARITY FOR ME
CTCBCK,	.		/*K* MAY NOT BE ZERO !
	KRS
	TAD	M203
	SZA CLA
	 JMP I CTCBCK	/NO, RETURN
	5357		/JMP BEEORC
M203,	-203
	RELOC
	0
	356		/BEEORC+1-1
	SKP
	0
	4765-1		/CTLBMS-1
	TEXT	*^C*	/*K* NOTE THE IMPLICIT ZERO !
	4002-1		/SKIP FLAG-CLEARING STUFF
	5233		/JMP LDPROG-1
	0

/AT LAST WE UPDATE THE VERSION NUMBER TO SHOW WHAT W'VE DONE
	FIELD 0
	*5535
	TEXT *M8 U*
/THAT'S IT. NOW LOAD IT AS FOLLOWS:
/	.PAL FRTSXX
/	.R ABSLDR
/	*FRTS.SV/I
/	*FRTSXX$
/	.SA SYS FRTS
